## 🟡 Bug 6 — IADL multi-order plans bypass `EXEC_LOCKED`

**[main.py:5172](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#L5172)**

IADL `CLOSE_THEN_REVERSE` and `UNWIND_STRADDLE` queue orders without checking `EXEC_LOCKED`, potentially sending sell+buy plan orders while another order is in-flight.

**Fix:**
```python
if _iadl_dec.plan and not SIMULATION_MODE and not EXEC_LOCKED:
```

