## 🟡 Bug 7 — Flat windows skip [settle_window](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#483-610) → statistical bias

**[main.py:3552-3554](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#L3552-L3554)**

If all positions exited before window end, [settle_window()](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#483-610) never fires. [record_pnl(0.0)](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#209-249) is skipped, so SPRT and rolling Sharpe never see zero-return windows — mild upward bias in rolling Sharpe.

---

