## 🟢 Bug 10 — L2 data not updated on `price_changes` deltas

`bids_l2`/`asks_l2` arrays are only set on full snapshots (line 3105-3112). The `price_changes` handler (line 3123-3161) updates top-of-book but leaves L2 stale, affecting [depth_decayed_imbalance()](file:///c:/Users/brock/Downloads/303-main/303-main/main.py#1052-1076).

